        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lukáš Dlouhý, Oliver Marach, Pavel Vízner, Albert Montañés, Rubén Ramírez Hidalgo\n- Events: 2007 Brasil Open – Doubles\n- Roles: professional tennis players, defending champions\n- Organizations: ATP Tour\n\nFacts:\n- Oliver Marach was born on 16 July 1980 and is an Austrian professional tennis player.\n- Lukáš Dlouhý was born on 9 April 1983 and is a professional Czech tennis player on the ATP Tour.\n- At the 2007 Brasil Open – Doubles, Lukáš Dlouhý and Pavel Vízner were the defending champions.\n- At the 2007 Brasil Open – Doubles, Lukáš Dlouhý and Pavel Vízner won the final 6–2, 7–6 against Albert Montañés and Rubén Ramírez Hidalgo.",
